1
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:43,719
The victim is He Shuyi,

2
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,079
a senior at Ancheng Medical University

3
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,439
and the son of the Ancheng Bank president.

4
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:51,600
The first ones to find the body

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,439
were Chen Xiaojing and Shi Meng.

6
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,960
The hallway and ward cameras were broken,

7
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:57,799
so we can't directly determine the cause of death.

8
00:00:58,159 --> 00:00:59,439
The victim's face was livid,

9
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,840
his pupils were dilated,

10
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,600
with a look of horror,

11
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,719
as though before he died,

12
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,599
he encountered something terrifying.

13
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:07,680
The preliminary assessment

14
00:01:07,799 --> 00:01:08,560
is that he was scared to death.

15
00:01:09,159 --> 00:01:10,120
But we still need the medical examiner

16
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:11,000
to conduct a further examination.

17
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,719
We ran into He Shuyi in the escape room.

18
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,840
He didn't look like someone who'd be scared to death.

19
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,519
Seriously,

20
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:21,519
are you Conan or something?

21
00:01:22,079 --> 00:01:23,439
A murder happens wherever you go.

22
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,280
Besides, with Gu Yan's leg,

23
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:26,599
should she even be visiting a place like this?

24
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,120
Great, look what happened.

25
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:31,079
Now both of you are suspects.

26
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:33,799
Let's go back and take your statements.

27
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:35,439
He had nothing to do with it.

28
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,680
I was the one who wanted to come.

29
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,319
I suspect

30
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:39,799
the founder of this escape room

31
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,400
is connected to the killer

32
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,359
from the serial murder case years ago.

33
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,200
That's why we had to clear the game

34
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,760
to get this commemorative coin.

35
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,599
Apart from the material,

36
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,840
the pattern on this coin

37
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,079
is identical to the one

38
00:01:53,079 --> 00:01:54,159
from the serial murder case.

39
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,480
He Shuyi had one in his hand too.

40
00:01:58,519 --> 00:02:00,120
We've started investigating this escape room.

41
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:01,959
We'll soon be able to question

42
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,040
the person in charge of it.

43
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:06,040
Let's go.

44
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,439
Head back and give your statements.

45
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:22,039
That's how it all played out.

46
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,479
Just as we were about to leave,

47
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:25,080
we heard Chen Xiaojing scream.

48
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:27,840
She discovered that the prop dummy on the bed

49
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,840
had turned into He Shuyi's corpse.

50
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:32,919
Shen Yu was right.

51
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,039
He Shuyi didn't die of fright.

52
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,000
According to the forensic report,

53
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,960
he died of cyanide poisoning.

54
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,120
It was premeditated murder.

55
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:42,719
Cyanide is colorless and highly toxic.

56
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,360
Within seconds of ingestion,

57
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:46,919
agitation and terror set in,

58
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:47,479
followed by cyanosis,

59
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,039
convulsions,

60
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,599
and difficulty breathing. Survival is rare.

61
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,960
That perfectly matches

62
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,039
He Shuyi's expression at the time of death.

63
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,360
At the time, He Shuyi was covered with a white sheet.

64
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:03,919
To beat the room,

65
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,639
every player had to lie on a hospital bed

66
00:03:05,919 --> 00:03:06,719
and pull the sheet over themselves.

67
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,879
If cyanide was liquefied

68
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,159
and absorbed into the sheet,

69
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,280
the murder could be pulled off.

70
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,680
Forensics is already collecting evidence

71
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,800
from the residue on the sheet.

72
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:16,840
For now,

73
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,159
you and Shen Yu

74
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:19,159
can be cleared of suspicion.

75
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,599
You didn't know He Shuyi,

76
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,960
so you have no motive.

77
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,840
Besides, with your mobility issues,

78
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:26,960
you weren't at the scene when it happened,

79
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:30,080
and Shen Yu was with you the entire time.

80
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,159
Did you look into the escape room's owner?

81
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,199
Did they turn the coin with that pattern

82
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,240
into a commemorative prize?

83
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,599
The owner is away on business.

84
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:39,759
His earliest flight back is tomorrow.

85
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,080
Even though the commemorative coin

86
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:44,400
is tied directly to the serial killer,

87
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,439
the person who killed He Shuyi

88
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,560
must be one of the remaining players.

89
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:00,000
Xu Xiaoya.

90
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,520
You teamed up with He Shuyi and left,

91
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,919
you teamed up with He Shuyi and left,

92
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,719
so what actually happened?

93
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:06,000
I wasn't teamed up with him.

94
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,439
Back then,

95
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:09,759
I just wanted to find an unlocked ward to hide in.

96
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,919
Once inside,

97
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,919
I chose the bed on the right and lay down.

98
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,280
Later on,

99
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:16,399
I heard that guy He come in.

100
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,839
You didn't notice his death throes?

101
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,319
After a while,

102
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:23,000
I did hear some muffled groans,

103
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,120
but

104
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:26,439
I thought he was just scared of the NPC.

105
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,480
Besides,

106
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:29,439
with a scumbag like him,

107
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,600
who would even care?

108
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,800
So I didn't pay any attention.

109
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:33,800
Then...

110
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,720
when Chen Xiaojing and the others entered,

111
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,160
didn't they make any noise either?

112
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,120
If she hadn't screamed,

113
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,120
I wouldn't have known he was dead.

114
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:44,959
The last person He Shuyi saw

115
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,079
before he died was Xu Xiaoya.

116
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,120
Our inquiry at her university revealed

117
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:50,199
that she has an awful personality,

118
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,879
though she has strong professional skills.

119
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,040
She wasn't close to her professors or peers.

120
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,839
As it stands,

121
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:57,040
she's the prime suspect.

122
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:58,720
Although the two were put in the same group,

123
00:04:59,279 --> 00:05:00,120
giving her the opportunity to strike,

124
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,720
what about the motive?

125
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:02,600
What was her motive?

126
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:03,879
According to the investigation so far,

127
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,240
they met each other

128
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,639
during their hospital internship.

129
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:08,079
They weren't classmates,

130
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,639
so they weren't close.

131
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:11,920
She admitted herself

132
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,279
her dissatisfaction with He Shuyi,

133
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,160
but only regarding his personal conduct

134
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:18,079
and messy romantic life.

135
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,480
Right.

136
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:21,000
During our interrogation,

137
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,839
whenever He Shuyi's name was brought up,

138
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,000
Xu Xiaoya

139
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:26,360
she wore her disgust all over her face.

140
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,279
Back in the escape room,

141
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:31,160
she had almost zero interaction with him,

142
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,160
mostly just rolling her eyes at him.

143
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:37,079
She had no motive to kill.

144
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,560
Unless...

145
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,959
Unless she's mentally deranged,

146
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,600
kills for fun,

147
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,639
and is used to doing so.

148
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:44,519
Yet based on what we saw in the escape room,

149
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,160
she doesn't fit that profile.

150
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,639
She's merely somewhat abrasive

151
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:51,120
and blunt.

152
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,600
If Xu Xiaoya

153
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,160
were truly a thrill-killer,

154
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,839
then facing police questioning,

155
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,839
she would have stayed completely calm,

156
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,319
rather than acting like she did during the interrogation.

157
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:02,639
I see now.

158
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:05,040
Xu Xiaoya may be a suspect,

159
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,480
but she lacks a motive.

160
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,800
When the NPC gave chase in the escape room,

161
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,560
if He Shuyi hadn't fought with Chen Xiaojing,

162
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:13,519
the one by his side wouldn't have been Xu Xiaoya;

163
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,839
it would've been Chen Xiaojing.

164
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,240
So Xu Xiaoya couldn't have had

165
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,600
a premeditated plan

166
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:19,079
to ensure she could kill He Shuyi.

167
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:23,959
What about Shi Meng and Chen Xiaojing?

168
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,560
Chen Xiaojing was He Shuyi's girlfriend.

169
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,839
She was also the first to find him dead.

170
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,040
Besides, back in the escape room,

171
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,720
He Shuyi was exposed

172
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,120
for cheating and lying.

173
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:36,000
They were on the verge of breaking up,

174
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,519
and things were really tense between them.

175
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,439
So while they were on the verge

176
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:41,360
of breaking up,

177
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,639
amid their heated conflict,

178
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:44,319
Shi Meng got into a fight with He Shuyi.

179
00:06:44,839 --> 00:06:45,879
Which means the two of them

180
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:47,079
currently have the strongest motives.

181
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:49,079
As for the quarrel and brawl,

182
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,560
during their interrogations,

183
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:52,680
they both admitted to it.

184
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:53,800
When questioning Shi Meng,

185
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,879
he said he couldn't stand He Shuyi.

186
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,360
Xu Xiaoya couldn't stand him either,

187
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,600
but she chose to stay away,

188
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:01,079
while Shi Meng chose to fight He Shuyi.

189
00:07:01,439 --> 00:07:03,959
Did the two of them have prior bad blood?

190
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,639
Not really.

191
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:05,839
It was probably because

192
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,920
Shi Meng has a crush on Chen Xiaojing.

193
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,920
Seeing the girl he likes being wronged

194
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,360
and mistreated,

195
00:07:10,959 --> 00:07:12,199
he couldn't help stepping in.

196
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:13,879
He's a student athlete, young and hot-blooded.

197
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:15,040
Yan,

198
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,199
how do you know

199
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,639
that Shi Meng likes Chen Xiaojing?

200
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,519
If they're close,

201
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,639
could Chen Xiaojing have committed murder

202
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,639
with Shi Meng as an accomplice?

203
00:07:23,839 --> 00:07:26,319
Or did they just collude from the start?

204
00:07:27,759 --> 00:07:28,480
It's simple.

205
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:30,079
When a group gathers together,

206
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,839
if there's someone you like,

207
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:34,120
then in a relaxed atmosphere,

208
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:36,040
you can't help looking at them.

209
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:38,120
That's true for both men and women.

210
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:40,240
Back in the escape room,

211
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:41,920
Shi Meng's eyes

212
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:43,560
were constantly on Chen Xiaojing.

213
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:45,279
When she smiled, he smiled too.

214
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,279
When she cried from being wronged,

215
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,079
he looked really upset.

216
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:51,800
Not to mention he even fought He Shuyi.

217
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:53,519
Right now,

218
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,879
the two of them are the prime suspects.

219
00:07:57,319 --> 00:07:58,680
Yet based on my observation,

220
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:01,399
Chen Xiaojing is meek and might be pregnant.

221
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,279
Even after being betrayed by her boyfriend,

222
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,959
she was too indecisive to break up.

223
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,959
After her boyfriend died,

224
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,279
she seemed

225
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,560
genuinely terrified.

226
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,720
It didn't look like an act.

227
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,920
As for Shi Meng,

228
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:14,279
if he really were the killer,

229
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,879
why would he pick a fight with him

230
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,120
right before making a move,

231
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,639
only to draw suspicion onto himself?

232
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,399
During the incident,

233
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,360
Lin Anzhe wasn't at the scene.

234
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,199
Yet afterward,

235
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,519
around the time we arrived,

236
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,800
he arrived around the same time we did.

237
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,680
When screening

238
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,360
the escape room staff,

239
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,680
we found Lin Anzhe's name.

240
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,240
But during his interrogation,

241
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,639
he never mentioned he worked there part-time.

242
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,559
He probably wanted you

243
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,960
to spend extra time investigating.

244
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,519
While dealing with him,

245
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,679
I'm sure you felt it too.

246
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:46,320
Lin Anzhe is very sharp; he's playing dumb.

247
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,639
Is this Morse code?

248
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,399
When it comes to others' business,

249
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,679
he just watches as a bystander.

250
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,399
He clearly knew

251
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,799
we'd definitely find out

252
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:03,519
that he works at the escape room,

253
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,559
yet he still refused to tell us.

254
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:06,799
The poisoned bedsheet

255
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,480
could have been planted beforehand

256
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:09,919
by a staff member,

257
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,600
who is highly familiar with cyanide.

258
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,679
I'll keep investigating Lin Anzhe.

259
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,120
Whether he's the killer or not,

260
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,919
he might know more information.

261
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,000
Yan,

262
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,200
what's your criminal profile of the killer?

263
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:22,120
Whether it's the players inside

264
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,399
or the staff outside,

265
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,600
they're all suspects.

266
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:26,360
But what's certain is

267
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:29,080
this person had bad blood with the victim,

268
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:30,279
and is an acquaintance.

269
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:32,440
The victim posed some kind of threat to him,

270
00:09:33,519 --> 00:09:34,480
whether it's romantic,

271
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:34,960
whether it's romantic,

272
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,879
academic,

273
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:38,039
or physical.

274
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:39,960
The killer is young,

275
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,639
likely close to the victim's age,

276
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,039
and is male.

277
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,080
To be honest,

278
00:09:44,559 --> 00:09:45,360
I think in this case,

279
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:46,799
more than one person was involved.

280
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,519
And most importantly,

281
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:50,840
the gold coin in He Shuyi's hand...

282
00:09:51,159 --> 00:09:52,000
Who gave it to him?

283
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,919
The last time he left our sight,

284
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,200
he didn't have the gold coin.

285
00:09:56,159 --> 00:09:56,840
Then who do you think

286
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,480
is the most suspicious?

287
00:10:01,159 --> 00:10:02,360
Without any evidence,

288
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,159
won't telling you bias your judgment?

289
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:07,720
Xu Xiaoya is a suspect,

290
00:10:08,279 --> 00:10:09,080
but she has no motive.

291
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,559
Chen Xiaojing and Shi Meng have motives

292
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:12,480
and match the criminal profile,

293
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:14,639
but there's no evidence or opportunity.

294
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:17,279
Lin Anzhe wasn't at the scene,

295
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:19,840
but he works at the escape room

296
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,600
and could have assisted the killer.

297
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:23,240
Seven people entered the escape room in total:

298
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:24,919
four men and three women.

299
00:10:25,679 --> 00:10:26,559
Rule them out one by one,

300
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,799
and the one left will be the answer.
